    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The authors use a combination of logit lens and causal tracing to analyze the internal mechanisms of the model. They find that the model forms a <strong>generalizing circuit</strong> during grokking, which allows it to reason implicitly. The circuit consists of states in different layers, where the lower layers retrieve the input facts and the upper layers store the output facts.",
