    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The study has implications for the development of more advanced language models. The authors suggest that <strong>parametric memory</strong> is essential for complex reasoning, and that the transformer architecture can be improved by encouraging cross-layer knowledge sharing. The study also highlights the importance of controlled experiments in understanding the limitations of language models.",
